{
  "item": "PantMale32",
  "mu_name": "Sylphid Ray Pants",
  "mu_name_from": "MuMain loads MODEL_SYLPHID_RAY_* from Data/Player/HDK_PantMale03.bmd (ZzzOpenData.cpp:222-232; the helm is HDK_HelmMale 3). MU's number 31. Ours is *Male32 by the index-plus-one rule; MU never loads a *Male32 file.",
  "why_this_one": "The Muse Elf's level-380 set, Kanturu's gear (the user, 2026-10-22: 'lets now cook kanturu weapons and armors', dormant until Kanturu drops them).",
